STATE

  VERSION reads 0.6.42 on dev (724b78a, check-all passed; recorded in
  tamlinux-packages 9e41c33 for bosgame Test). Meta + Return launches a new
  tam-last 0.2.4 window using tam-clam 0.3.5, preferring executable
  $HOME/.local/bin/tam-last and $HOME/.local/bin/tam-clam when present
  and falling back to /usr/bin/tamlinux/ (W29). Source installs pin both
  commands, and clipboard history paste targets the originating
  tam-last window. The current release is 0.5.12. Tamlinux 0.6 is the
  dependable Arch/Hyprland baseline.

  For Tamlinux 0.7.0 Northern Torch:
  - Milestone 1 (bosgame app and launcher checklist) is complete (W26).
  - Milestone 2 (reproducible tam-pane session and local development
    loop) is complete on dev (W31): components.lock pins tam-pane
    7ca46a8 (0.2.6 + one-handed chord composer) with libtam 0.9.1
    (a3e0901); build.py stages the native-Wayland (XWAYLAND=0) build;
    preflight.py and arch-packages check wayland, wayland-protocols,
    wlroots0.20, and libxkbcommon; install-cultivar-layout.py stages
    /usr/share/wayland-sessions/tam-pane.desktop, tam-pane-session, and
    versioned tam-pane.lua defaults; tam-pane-session honors
    TAM_PANE_BIN and PATH (~/.local/bin/tam-pane) with fallback to the
    packaged cultivar binary; and tam-dev supports tam-pane.
  - Milestone 3 (two guarded console launches) is complete on dev (W33):
    tam-desktop pane launches tam-pane trials, tam-desktop hyprland
    launches Hyprland recovery, and bare tam-desktop (and start) stays
    routed to the default desktop (Hyprland until Milestone 10). Local VT,
    duplicate-session, TAM_PANE_SOCKET cleanup, and shutdown-wait checks in
    console.py and wait-stopped.py cover both Hyprland and tam-pane, and
    session_settings.py validates each session independently (--session
    hyprland|pane) so Hyprland starts even if tam-pane.lua is unavailable.
  - Milestone 4 (bring up the complete session) is complete on dev (W34):
    uwsm-env preserves XDG_CURRENT_DESKTOP/XDG_SESSION_DESKTOP set by uwsm
    start -e -D <desktop> and exports UWSM_WAIT_VARNAMES and
    UWSM_FINALIZE_VARNAMES with TAM_PANE_SOCKET for tam-pane; tam-pane.lua
    runs uwsm finalize TAM_PANE_SOCKET and launches xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
    via tp.capture for PipeWire ScreenCast/Screenshot; cultivar defaults
    and session_settings.py publish and validate tam-pane-portals.conf
    independently of Hyprland; and arch-packages/preflight.py declare the
    portal and PipeWire prerequisites (xdg-desktop-portal-wlr still needs
    installation on bosgame before hardware ScreenCast proof).

  The repository follows the tam-idol 1.1.0 layout (W16). Source
  installation builds pinned clones, verifies native prerequisites and
  destination ownership, and selects the installed cultivar by digest.
  The shared keybinding standard now lives in tam-idol under
  keys/keybindings.md. The old arch/keybindings.md links to it (W32).


